  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa1bc9afcc9e22fae3798130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "报告，\r\n有新的通知，\r\n请尽快确认。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3c8db1d6fd3a31c5820190677c8922e1b6bd135a697900cfb91c42de75b9e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44bd164d0e6817cb1f868398",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来有礼物送来了。\r\n安全已确认，\r\n请放心收下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f8b443c7135a9fd2203b9826895c24103e6546cfbc8c1bf084979dbad94f292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35a8493069f2c75c378f24a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成……太棒了！\r\n不愧是您，我的主君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af6c44ffce4bcf0042d669641610b28588d4b12065a2ef4f2d7a8ff0c7914a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f3dfdc1b85afb8f9186232d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来有活动要举行，\r\n请做好万全准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaaffa08897a25a1a716f2593a759b7c73fe2f3d8971782105a73bffc432d41a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d9a54454af11f3f54ef66bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了呢，\r\n您要参加吗？\r\n我会陪伴左右！",
      "source_fingerprint": "603e9265c5afc6c55a3c446e11b5dfc1b1e43870b63c5107130e5b389598586f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:957581720919b516eba77a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再战一次吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca42811291ddbc81ebdc5cdd027bbb08da44acfe96021eaf161df434bb5cf85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c99bb5fa7269cd4bbb3258",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘图鉴的等级提升了。\r\n不愧是您，我的主君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d77008e71f172cf77a151816298facdf5a6b3e2ea0ff2a192d435ddb84e5ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42566aab14291a402d4977e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白色象征纯净，红色代表\n热情……  我的衣着，正映\n照出我的内心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6088164eddc5bc80b3f6a89abe6148bcd186575f7d0a7aafe9a374682e827c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60ee7493606179ab70377b6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一分每一秒，与吾君共度的\n时间，都在悄然铭刻…这座时钟，\n便如同那相伴的见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff3118a6bb5b961fa4dafa457c072799314eae01a13d66c208eaf82c6ba39fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a565e6b9aadd05a15aa09f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使与友人共度的时光，也绝不会\n忘记身为骑士的矜持。重视礼节，\n保持高洁之姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39c8cba8f428e67b8f436f59532d816cf482770136d1a279fd45648ef56fa76d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92f85a04d6ee7b9d1c4d201b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分不出胜负吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ec663ac17b0e240f1ab257073ef28574c534d6ca221b9865bfa4054c564732",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0078480d768a02aa10a2bad6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是精彩绝伦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24839b7d439c6733b2402100dd226adf9379a44690f854aa115e5e0346f90fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d3fb104d607451d91dac89a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再战一次吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ca42811291ddbc81ebdc5cdd027bbb08da44acfe96021eaf161df434bb5cf85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a34575dd53cbf91b407a4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "分不出胜负吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0ec663ac17b0e240f1ab257073ef28574c534d6ca221b9865bfa4054c564732",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9e91b9e6502aafba793ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是值得夸奖的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1753c1f9fe535aa95d293318c47cb1e17701313aeaa21f6c73bb06ab13239315",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eec53e67f3ed41280cb92455",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集结在我的『圣剑』下吧，勇士们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5e5ca9c7dde835e4157628137a2136dbffaec21b19fd6c598a05da2c634c2f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb174641db4f0efd86f97128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d879f8c451f371afa2ec84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练吗？\r\n交给我吧，\r\n准备已经就绪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db6daa4b3cf40e8bee47377ce7334f18c4ac43c2e14210230f4fb4e36ee35893",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ae9747bb5f64c61d9167d27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在许多叙事诗中，\r\n也铭刻着我们的足迹呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf964e18fd336f13fd843453c174d01eff3fb46a5af106487735936e248c8f31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e51d060f7f47645b7a1a60d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时都要胸怀骄傲…\r\n我们出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d089119348d7e45c452518bf0a70cffb9b7dd4cd8f45ef02b6a1a02441bc1f97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c912177e435810ba3443af41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b2d516b114ec91c8d0f4bee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉有力量注入了我的身体…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f53eff5307bece25001cfaeab95fa331aa0fdd4d132d3f3f2125983a39755f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26177dc8d01f744174352502",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献给吾君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f42f870384e8ebd9499b9f1e22e6a361e2a581b6aec017c7ddee02bc42757dba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d564c2a3a557663095ab227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "殿下，请您伸手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c338d96fc82cdb742f3bb610dd06113372dbae994dd0b9560f065ab93b047429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3296c3f717e0e0d29a34cd73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "贯彻到底！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2885b1889ea784ea02e72ca3226f52f8307151db9cd3ac0a793e6db8637e4ba8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "1246"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e86c53f2bcf1d3c2fd46d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5b710ecc1e596d3cbcf377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝您武运昌隆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9241e4bbd1e20744a4758274b9b009ff602c764b40c8489fa19c61af4a2f05e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ff3cfca3fc156418869380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是您，我的主君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6243a50d3087892373af51918bfb2641e5fd8d4ce934e5c2b88a0e8f3d1ccfdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4988fd2c676b4652489f27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2e65d416a574b954ab3c98b7dc3e00b5d24154bd5b58c0a1d0d7f9ccbc053e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1121",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07882e5a0a80384245d0634b",
